                    <span class="text-sm font-bold text-[#C6A87C] uppercase tracking-wider">Ω-FRAG-007</span>
                    <span class="text-sm text-gray-400">|</span>
                    <span class="text-sm text-gray-600">v7 · 2026-08-21</span>
